ng", "id": "1696637708132244", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1696637714798910_4946681219789494925_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8phq_Dqw3EEQ7kNvwGFgeJi&_nc_oc=AdqKV5YT13odish5BEd3B_wv3VwLILgsotDj-ApX4rEPSm9cW0J_1OW7YD3ajjYTlak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzk1y0t3pvdiQKv1AXy66jERZ8s4Q-mf4FRkznyUgi2A&oe=6B09A051"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4383046621951627", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_4383046625284960_6704386613672609703_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R2fIUn2CrYkQ7kNvwEC14Ss&_nc_oc=AdrC9gMu-pEOSFu1MB6xnBZ5XKgFELpnIPWuOXGS-3hfQ4clfuSPfhMq1dCURLDgZPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_fU2mRfCTzQXfaeafQViqcPV6CkgBdmpy2JZDOd09gg&oe=6B09A735"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "851768347981596", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_851768351314929_2053146473754133296_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WpAeh8gGpa8Q7kNvwFRt-9C&_nc_oc=AdqRq01QCN_veE91pzJ3A3sgJBJ6c6GHBkrtuQPnfHitTy9SMpevzjk2RaosU1LUgtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTDOfVc7UG5_1YcpCwREShrMt2-LPkgemprGZYcK4DkVA&oe=6B09CA00"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1632542594489813", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1632542597823146_3689544893099760675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hi_OnoDZSoUQ7kNvwFIWlV0&_nc_oc=AdpaBeWNdezIHoycKsoPIGQo3o2JWngBof12IiGFcybRITEb3sglPdYDIA2nXEXSUt0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTI9rL7-MUXlyNhRcHenc_7LoJf5mUF4LQ-PJzpKHIxUQ&oe=6B09B19D"}, "display_name": "Cortex Quest", "keywords": ["educational", "science", "biology", "ear", "psychology"], "long_description": "**WARNING:** This game must be played by at least 2 people. One player is immersed in VR, while their partner must have the Support File in hand: https://cortexquest.github.io/VR.\n# Train your brain. Become the system.\n\nStep into a VR experience where science meets gameplay. CORTEX QUEST is a collection of immersive mini-games for anyone ready to explore the mysteries of the human brain and sensory systems.\n\n# PSYCHOLOGY SIMULATIONS - Perception is not reality\n\nExperience neurological disorders and how perception can dramatically change.\n\nExplore three fascinating conditions:\n\n- Prosopagnosia - struggle to recognize faces and rely on alternative cues\n- Hemineglect - navigate a world where half of reality seems to disappear\n- Body Ownership Impairment - question what truly belongs to your own body\n\nEach simulation challenges your senses and shows how the brain constructs reality.\n\n# BIOLOGY ADVENTURE - HEAR WE GO!\n\nA scientific accident has changed everything\u2026 Your team of biologists has been miniaturized and sent inside the human body. Your mission: explore the auditory system and uncover how we perceive sound.\n\nEquipped with advanced VR tools, you will:\n\n- Dive into the cochlea and uncover its mechanics\n- Activate hair cells and observe how sound becomes signals\n- Manipulate sound frequencies to understand pitch perception\n- Trigger action potentials and follow neural pathways\n- Travel to the auditory cortex\n\nLearn hearing by doing, experimenting, and interacting.", "short_description": "CORTEX QUEST is an educational two-player VR experience where one player explores the brain and body, while a partner guides them through puzzles about perception, neurological disorders, and hearing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://novascience.github.io/VR/PrivacyPolicy/CortexQuestPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dawson College", "support_website_url":